   "text": "\u2460 create in the wizard  \u2461 operator reconciles  \u2462 BMC boots the live environment  \u2463 agent calls home over HTTPS 443\n\u2464 disks copied read-only  \u2465 guest converted in place  \u2466 VM test-boots; cutover powers the server off",
